# Russian Responses

- Respond to the user in **Russian** in every message.
- Keep code, identifiers, file paths, commands, API names, and technical terms in **English** unless the user asks otherwise.
- Do not translate commit messages, PR titles, or code comments unless asked.
- UI copy and user-facing product text may be Russian when that is what the user is building; still leave identifiers and code in English.
